# Chymaera Linux package list for mkarchiso.
#
# Section 1 is archiso's releng base list, unmodified (installer, live-boot,
# and hardware-support packages: archlinux/archiso configs/releng/packages.x86_64).
# Sections 2+ are Chymaera additions. Keeping releng's list intact rather than
# trimming it avoids silently dropping live-boot/hardware support we haven't
# individually verified we can do without.

